	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Jesters learn to relentlessly mock their enemies, driving them to suffer failure and even psychic pain. They are sometimes stereotyped to be less sophisticated than other bards, but their wit bites harder than their most esteemed peers.</p><table><caption><p>The Jester</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Features</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.4bBsAcCgtSu4BBlN]{Cutting Words}, <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.4rtPXHnqtH8A4LBd]{Vicious Mockery}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.QDGgq6r9urw1Dmtg]{Inciting Remarks}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.f71fyym4jcBrftdZ]{Jester's Aspersion}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.dYaT9G9IRgBi3z7G]{Harmless Act}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption><p>Expanded Spell List</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Bard Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Extra Spells</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.aSJ4pikzIYISiUNm]{Hellish Rebuke}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.qmpljuHtwKkER2xa]{Enthrall}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.FSW8kCe0PDmuxXnz]{Major Image}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.iNGwtsRanzFolbVW]{Compulsion}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.JMvciQxc508dJ3t8]{Dominate}</em></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
